ACT and SmolVLA reference cases use Hugging Face LeRobot 0.3.3, Apache-2.0,
at b883328e6c95681ca90a18b102e4ae5e1f91e2bf.
https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/tree/b883328e6c95681ca90a18b102e4ae5e1f91e2bf

The camera test pattern is original test data created by OpenAgents and
released under CC0-1.0. The generated reference weights are stored outside
this repository. These random reference cases establish numerical agreement;
they are not evidence of task performance.

SmolVLA cases also pin Transformers 4.51.3 (Apache-2.0), using a tiny
original configuration and supplied noise. They cover the full vision,
language, and action path without fetching pretrained weights.
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/tree/v4.51.3
